  "note": "The Lean does not state this display. `Prelim.cntSq_approx` inverts the squarefree and coprimality condition per modulus P (with P = 2r₁r₂) on a generic interval [a,b], using `Prelim.coprime_indicator` and `Prelim.sum_moebius_sq_dvd`, so one divisor e plays the role of d₁d₂d₃."
